  "summary_en": "NSW Government end-user do/don't guidance on using public generative AI tools such as DALL-E. It requires fact-checking outputs, protecting personal and sensitive information, respecting copyright, and not letting AI make decisions. It also bars unofficial tools and unapproved dataset ingestion, and directs staff to security teams when in doubt.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Fact check and verify outputs before official use",
   "Do not let generative AI make decisions for the NSW Government",
   "Do not input personal, sensitive, classified or health information",
   "Do not use AI-generated code in government systems or ingest government datasets without approval",
   "Enable multifactor authentication, disable training/logging and chat history, seek privacy or security advice if unsure"
